    "decoder_content_3": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Contractors Use This Decoder"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Speed matters when a contract deadline is close, and a packaging specialist isn't available. This tool gives program managers, quality engineers, and small packaging shops the same information in the same amount of time, without waiting on a callback or digging through a PDF to find the page they need.</p><p>Royco Packaging keeps this decoder updated as standards change. The tool accounts for revisions such as MIL-PRF-81705F, which replaced the earlier MIL-PRF-81705E revision, when a code references those barrier materials.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
