    "decoder_content_4": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Matching Codes to Certified Materials"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Translating a code is only half the job. The next step is sourcing packaging that meets the code's requirements. This is where many buyers run into trouble if their supplier only sells commercial-grade barrier bags or generic tape.</p><p>Royco Packaging manufactures roll stock, barrier bags, desiccants, VCI materials, and boxes to military and commercial specifications. These products meet the requirements referenced in MIL-STD-2073 and related standards. Roll stock and finished bags also ship with the documentation quality teams need, including certificates of conformance when required.</p><p>Same-day shipment is available on many in-stock rolls and bags. Working directly with a manufacturer instead of a reseller can also speed up turnaround. This is especially helpful when a code calls for a less common combination of preservation method and packing level.</p>"
          }
        },
